y in our response. We appreciate your patience and would like to inform you that the No Dues Certificate (NOC) has been shared with you via a separate email. Please note that the document is password-protected for security purposes. To access the document, kindly use the following format for the password: the last four digits of your registered mobile number followed by your date of birth in DDMMYY format. Example: If your registered mobile number is 9876543210 and your date of birth is 01-05-2000, the password would be: 3210010500 
In addition, we are happy to introduce DMI self-service portal, your one-stop place for all your loan-related queries. Login and access your welcome letter, repayment schedule, payment summary, and account summary, statement of account and NOC with a three-step easy process:
1. Click https://portal.dmifinance.in/
