lac. Rs. So, the agent informed the customer, "We sincerely apologize for the delay in our response, we appreciate your patience. We are writing to you regarding the query on part payment charges that you raised with us. We would like to inform you that you can conveniently make your advance part payment using digital payment applications such as GPay, PhonePe, and Paytm. Please note that an advance part payment charge of 4% will be levied, which you are required to pay along with the part payment amount.
Understanding Advance Part Payment
Advance part payment allows you to pay a portion of your loan amount before the scheduled EMI cycle. This helps in reducing your overall outstanding balance and future interest burden.
How Does It Work?
1. You initiate an advance part payment through GPay, PhonePe, or Paytm.
2. The amount paid is adjusted against your principal outstanding balance.
3. A 4% charge is applied on the advance part payment amount as per policy.
4. After adjustment, your loan account reflects a reduced outstanding balance, which may lower your future EMIs or shorten your loan tenure."</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>86.11</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>86.11</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>DMI</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>-</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>Retail Email & Tickets</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>-</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>-</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>1/15/2026 18:17:10</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>Jan'26</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'></td><td style='border:1px solid black;'></td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>-</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>Pass</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>10</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>10</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'></td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>0</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'></td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>N/A</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>0</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>0</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'></td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>0</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'></td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>Pass</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>5</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>5</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'></td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>0</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'></td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>Pass</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>5</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>5</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'></td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>0</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'></td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>N/A</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>0</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>0</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'></td><td style='border:1px solid black;'>0</td><td style='border:1px solid black;'></td><td style='border:1px solid black;