is loan, but showing as active. So, the agent informed the customer, "We sincerely apologize for the delay in our response and appreciate your patience. we confirm that your loan account has been successfully closed in our records.

We are writing to you in reference to the concern you raised. As requested, the No Dues Certificate (NOC) has been shared with you via a separate email. Please note that the document is password-protected for security purposes.

To access the document, kindly use the following format for the password: the last four digits of your registered mobile number followed by your date of birth in DDMMYY format.

Example: If your registered mobile number is 9876543210 and your date of birth is 01-05-2000, the password would be: 3210010500.

In addition, we are happy to introduce the DMI Self-Service Portal, your one-stop place for all loan-related queries. You can log in and access your welcome letter, repayment schedule, payment summary, account summary, statement of account, and NOC in three easy steps:

